{
  "summary": "This experiment tested a multimodal model combining scvi_n200 (RNA) and resnet50 (image) encoders with avgpool aggregation and concat fusion. Validation accuracy (0.6315) and F1 (0.6068) are lower than the RNA-only scvi_n200 baseline (0.6501), suggesting image integration may not improve performance. However, the exact impact of the image modality or fusion method remains uncertain without direct comparison to alternative image encoders or fusion strategies."
}

